  "content": "<div class=\"html-chunk\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Recursion</span><b><strong> </strong></b><span>is a technique used in computer science to solve big problems by breaking them into smaller, similar problems. The process in which a function calls itself directly or indirectly is called </span><b><strong>recursion </strong></b><span>and the corresponding function is called a recursive function. Using a recursive algorithm, certain problems can be solved quite easily.</span></p><h2 id=\"learn-basics-of-recursion-algorithms\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>Basics</span></h2><ul><li value=\"1\"><a href=\"/#/article/dsa/dsa-014\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Introduction </span></a><span> </span></li><li value=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/tail-recursion/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Tail Recursion</span></a></li><li value=\"3\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/tail-call-elimination/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Tail Recursion Elimination</span></a></li></ul><h2 id=\"recursion-in-different-languages\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>In Different Languages</span></h2><ul><li value=\"1\"><a href=\"/#/article/python/python-014\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Recursion in Python</span></a></li><li value=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/java/recursion-in-java/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Recursion in Java</span></a></li><li value=\"3\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/c-sharp/recursion-in-c-sharp/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Recursion in C#</span></a></li><li value=\"4\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/javascript/how-to-understand-recursion-in-javascript/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Recursion in JavaScript</span></a></li></ul><h2 id=\"easy-problems-on-recursion\" style=\"text-align:left\"><b><strong>Easy </strong></b><span>Problems</span></h2><ul><li value=\"1\"><a href=\"/#/article/dsa/dsa-026